<view class="welcome-page">
  <view class="logo-section">
    <image class="logo-icon" src="../../assets/logo.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <text class="logo-text">Miao</text>
  </view>
  <text class="main-title">遇见你的数字猫咪伙伴</text>
  <text class="main-desc">上传真实照片生成专属形象，或选择预设猫咪快速开始陪伴。</text>
  <text wx:if="{{isRedemption}}" class="redemption">{{redemptionText}}</text>
  <view class="option-cards">
    <view class="option-card" bindtap="goUpload">
      <view class="card-header">
        <view class="card-icon-box"><image class="card-icon" src="/assets/profile-icons/upload-primary.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view>
        <text class="card-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
      <text class="card-title">上传猫咪照片</text>
      <text class="card-desc">AI 捕捉猫咪特征，生成更贴近真实猫咪的数字形象。</text>
      <view class="upload-hint"><text class="upload-hint-text">RECOMMENDED</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="option-card" bindtap="goCreate">
      <view class="card-header">
        <view class="card-icon-box"><image class="card-icon" src="/assets/profile-icons/sparkles-primary.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view>
        <text class="card-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
      <text class="card-title">选择预设猫咪</text>
      <text class="card-desc">先用预设形象创建伙伴，快速体验视频生成流程。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="footer" bindtap="logout"><text class="footer-text">退出登录</text></view>
</view>
